# PRIVATE DATA — never commit real dossiers or decisions to the public repo.
# These folders hold candid notes about real people. Keep them local only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# All real dossiers / decisions...
people/*
boss/*
decisions/*

# ...EXCEPT the example, the placeholders, and any folder READMEs, so the repo
# still ships a usable, navigable skeleton.
!people/daniel.md          # seeded EXAMPLE (fictional) — safe to share
!people/README.md
!boss/.gitkeep
!boss/README.md
!decisions/.gitkeep
!decisions/README.md

# Common local cruft
.DS_Store
*.local.md
